WEBVTT

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:08.940
<i>A moment in which a distinct reality was singled out</i>

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:12.440
<i>from the countless possible intertwined truths.</i>

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>That's what happened when I saw Muroto-senpai in a swimsuit.</i>

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.130
Muroto-senpai?

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.400
That's impressive!

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.310
Muroto-senpai!

00:00:42.110 --> 00:00:43.180
Maeda-kun?

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:45.940
Staying after school for club activities today?

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:46.840
Yeah.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:49.820
I want to get some good pictures for the exhibit this year.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:53.650
Taking pictures is fine, but I hope you
aren't using them for anything <i>strange</i>.

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.890
Wh-Whatever do you mean?

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:00.390
Sensei, please wait here while I go grab a kickboard.

00:01:00.390 --> 00:01:01.500
It's fine.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:04.680
I'm the one who's being taught, so I'll go.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:07.340
You'd get lost on the way there.

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:13.380
Maeda-kun, you'd better not blab.

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:15.850
O-Okay...

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:22.750
Sensei, are you learning how to swim?

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:23.720
Yeah.

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:26.440
I want to earn the credentials
for teaching elementary school,

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:29.940
and being able to swim fifty meters is a prerequisite.

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:32.440
So you asked Muroto-senpai to teach you?

00:01:32.440 --> 00:01:36.260
Oh, I'm not just getting taught here.

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:39.080
I'm helping her with her studies too.

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:41.320
So you've got a deal going on?

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:42.780
That's right.

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:46.750
And I want to take some of
the load off her shoulders, too.

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:53.090
She even quit the Swim Club to fulfill her duties as the student council president.

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:54.260
It's the least I could do.

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.410
Where'd this rain come from?!

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.820
I hope my camera's okay.

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:41.650
What the heck was that?!

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:43.030
Muroto-senpai?

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:45.150
Maeda-kun?

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:46.780
You got caught in it too?

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:47.990
Yeah.

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:50.080
Looks like we're stuck here for the time being.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.170
I hope the rain will stop soon.

00:04:00.990 --> 00:04:02.300
What are you taking pictures for?!

00:04:02.650 --> 00:04:05.180
Geez, can't I take my eyes off you for a second?

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:06.220
Illicit entry.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:13.540
Fine!

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:15.730
You just want photos, right? Take them!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:18.190
Could you pose for me, then?

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:19.900
P-Pose?!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:20.940
Here?!

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:22.700
What if someone sees me?!

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:25.280
Fine, I'll do it.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:26.990
Just make it quick.

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:29.160
Ooh, nice!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.290
Very nice!

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:34.000
Could you relax your legs some more next?

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:36.580
L-Like this?

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:37.600
Is this good?

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.590
How is it?

00:04:48.260 --> 00:04:49.970
Then what about this?

00:04:49.970 --> 00:04:51.100
Nice!

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:52.310
Very nice!

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:57.980
It's scary how I'm starting to get used to this.

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:00.940
Nicely done, Maeda.

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:03.950
Truly excellent.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:14.080
Man, the pleasure in blackmailing that stickler Muroto-senpai really is something else!

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.250
Oh, I'd better hurry.

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.300
Muroto-senpai?

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.720
It really was you.

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:30.510
Maeda-kun...

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:33.350
Class started, you know.

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:35.730
Whatever. I don't care about class.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.270
H-Huh?

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.850
Did something happen?

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:44.490
Why don't you take one?

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:48.860
The student council president is skipping classes on the roof.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:51.240
Perfect blackmail material, don't you think?

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:54.700
Hey...

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.290
What's wrong?

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:57.580
You're not acting like yourself.

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:58.830
Leave me alone!

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:06.420
Senpai, come with me.

00:06:07.550 --> 00:06:08.840
Let's go!

00:06:08.840 --> 00:06:11.680
Hey, wait, Maeda-kun!

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:14.180
What?

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:16.600
Why did you take me back here?

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:19.850
Your class-skipping skills are quite lacking.

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:23.610
Sulking in a place like that doesn't count as relaxing.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:26.780
That's a little much.

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.360
Then what's the right way?

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:31.950
We're going to do something better than illicit entry.

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.160
We're making an illicit exit!

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.160
Huh?

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.160
Yup.

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:43.210
Huh?

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:44.550
What's up?

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:46.540
Come on, use me as a step!

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:47.170
Quick!

00:06:47.170 --> 00:06:49.180
H-Hold on...

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:51.010
I can't do that.

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:55.890
If you skip class with me, I'll delete the illicit entry photo.

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.390
Why would you do that?

00:06:58.390 --> 00:06:59.770
Why?

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:01.480
Why, huh?

00:07:02.710 --> 00:07:06.280
You aren't acting like yourself, and I don't like it.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:07.780
I can't ignore it!

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:10.780
Come on, Senpai!

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:12.490
Get on top of me!

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:13.490
Come on!

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:16.580
Maeda-kun...

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:33.970
Wh-What are they doing?

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:36.560
Huh?

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:43.400
Hey, don't just stand there!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.520
We're tailing 'em!

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:45.940
Huh? Okay!

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:54.490
I'm the student council president, but
here I am at an arcade, skipping school...

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:55.910
Can't turn back now.

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:57.830
We might as well enjoy this.

00:07:57.830 --> 00:08:00.290
I don't know about that...

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.830
There you go again with the photography!

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.130
Come on, Muroto-senpai!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:07.340
Gimme some peace!

00:08:07.710 --> 00:08:09.020
I see.

00:08:09.020 --> 00:08:11.670
So you'll delete the illicit entry photo,

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:15.140
only to blackmail me with an illicit exit photo.

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.390
I won't do that. Trust me.

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:19.310
Come on, let's get another shot.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:20.430
Geez...

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:52.800
Eating crepes knowing that everyone else is in class is out of this world.

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:54.760
True.

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:59.310
Hey, you said I wasn't acting like myself, right?

00:08:59.310 --> 00:09:01.020
Huh? Yeah.

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:04.230
What kind of person do you see me as?

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:06.600
Let's see...

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:08.900
A strict student council president,

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:11.180
and the greatest prodigy ever
to attend Kouga Academy—

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:13.490
Prodigy, huh?

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:18.370
My grades back in elementary school weren't all that great.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.540
I loved swimming,

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:23.910
and I absolutely <i>hated</i> studying.

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.370
But then, why...

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:31.120
I have to follow in my father's
footsteps and become a doctor.

00:09:31.730 --> 00:09:34.380
Though I hated studying,
I couldn't avoid it forever.

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.880
I went to tons of extra classes,

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:40.390
even on weekends and holidays, from morning till night.

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:45.060
And then, when I graduated from elementary school,

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:47.390
I finally reached the top.

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:48.770
I was really happy.

00:09:53.530 --> 00:09:56.610
I've just pretended to be smart all this time.

00:09:57.150 --> 00:10:00.910
But your grades <i>are</i> really good.

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:06.870
You'd be shocked if you saw what I
got on the last national mock exam.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.000
No way...

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.710
But it's just a mock exam, right?

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:12.170
The real thing's a long ways off.

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.090
I'm at my limit.

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:16.170
I even quit swimming to study more,

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:17.760
but that was the best I could do.

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:22.140
I'm not cut out to be a student council president or a doctor.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:24.010
I can't be anything.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:26.060
Senpai...

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:28.440
Oh, I remember you.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:29.310
Yes?

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:32.520
You're the girl from the other day!

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:35.030
Oh, that morning...

00:10:35.030 --> 00:10:37.740
Um... Is something the matter?

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:39.780
You don't know about it?

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:43.530
This girl saved someone's life!

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:45.490
Muroto-senpai did?

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.320
That's right.

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:50.540
It was a Monday morning last month.

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:56.050
An old man collapsed here in this shopping district.

00:10:56.050 --> 00:11:00.550
We were panicking because we couldn't find an emergency room that would take him,

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:06.520
but then this girl came by and made
arrangements at her family's hospital.

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:08.060
She even accompanied him there.

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:12.610
If it weren't for her, who knows what might've happened to the old man?

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:16.440
Monday morning?

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:21.330
<i>That's right, I caught her on a Monday morning too.</i>

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:23.370
<i>Does that mean...</i>

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:26.620
Thank you so much.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:28.250
Everyone thought highly of you.

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:30.290
You're such a good girl.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.710
That's not true.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.050
I...

00:11:36.050 --> 00:11:40.090
I'm not as good a person as people think I am.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:42.090
Senpai...

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:43.940
R-Really?

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:46.000
All the same, everyone's truly thankful.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:48.140
I just wanted you to know that.

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.100
Okay.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.110
I'm...

00:12:11.740 --> 00:12:13.250
President?!

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:15.960
Leave them alone.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:19.760
Breaking into their world would be in poor taste.

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:23.220
Capturing the true Muroto is Maeda's job.

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:30.350
<i>After that, we continued our illicit outing.</i>

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:51.330
Maeda-kun, thanks for today.

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.960
I feel a lot better now.

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:57.170
I had fun skipping school with you too.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:59.780
This'll be the first and last time.

00:12:59.780 --> 00:13:01.590
Experiences like this don't happen often!

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:04.510
Hey, Maeda-kun.

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:07.720
You don't have to delete the photos anymore.

00:13:09.170 --> 00:13:13.310
I'm thinking of facing myself.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:15.340
The me that likes to swim.

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:17.270
The me that wants to be a doctor.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:19.730
The me guilty of illicit entry.

00:13:20.050 --> 00:13:22.150
They're all different facets of me.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:24.740
I realized that while having fun with you today.

00:13:25.310 --> 00:13:28.240
So please, don't delete any of the photos.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:30.950
Well then, see you at school.

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:39.500
<i>That's when I realized...</i>

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:45.970
<i>the only thing holding us together had disappeared.</i>

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:56.770
Muroto-senpai!

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:06.780
<i>I invited her on a date.</i>

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:09.990
<i>What's with me?</i>

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:12.640
<i>Muroto-senpai, do I actually...</i>

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.240
Maeda-kun.

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:28.800
I haven't been here in forever, so
I've been looking forward to this!

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:32.180
We have some time until the dolphin show.

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:34.060
Let's have a look around before it starts.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:41.310
I love how they look when they're swimming.

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:43.270
Me too.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:46.990
But there's something else that I'd rather take pictures of.

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:48.280
What?

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:50.360
How <i>you</i> look when <i>you're</i> swimming.

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:51.320
What?!

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:52.970
It's a real pity.

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:55.880
If only I'd known you before you quit swimming,

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:58.080
I could've taken more pictures of you diving.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:02.960
W-Well, I wouldn't mind letting you take pictures of me diving anytime you want.

00:15:02.960 --> 00:15:04.460
What? Really?!

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:05.340
When?!

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.970
What do you mean, "When"?

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:10.840
The dolphin show will begin shortly.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:15.220
All visitors who wish to view the show should proceed to the amphitheater.

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:12.850
It's starting.

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:13.850
Let's go.

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:28.900
One time, I was saved by dolphins.

00:15:28.900 --> 00:15:29.860
Dolphins?!

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:34.700
Well, they didn't save me from drowning or anything like that.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:35.870
Oh, okay.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:39.870
There was a time when I was really down.

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:42.880
My dad took me to see a dolphin show.

00:15:43.870 --> 00:15:45.630
I was really moved.

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:49.800
It was like my sadness got blown completely away.

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:56.390
I started diving because I wanted to be able to swim like them.

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:01.560
Why didn't you tell them?

00:16:03.020 --> 00:16:05.940
That you were late because you were
helping someone at the shopping district.

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:09.400
Then you wouldn't have needed to make an illicit entry.

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:15.070
That was the day you snuck into school, right?

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:18.040
Yes, it was.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:20.040
I wonder too.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:22.410
All I had to do was tell them.

00:16:50.870 --> 00:16:52.690
The sunset's always so pretty.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:53.820
Yeah.

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:55.600
Senpai.

00:16:55.600 --> 00:17:00.740
I thought you were a really strict person when I first met you.

00:17:02.330 --> 00:17:05.750
But I got to know more about you,

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:08.590
and I gradually...

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:15.130
I'm glad you took me out on that illicit exit.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:19.350
I wouldn't mind if you found out about the real me.

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.000
Senpai...

00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:22.850
I finally realized.

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:27.810
They're all parts of me, parts that are
serious about becoming perfect, but can't.

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:31.150
That's why I'm thinking about facing them.

00:17:31.770 --> 00:17:35.860
And it's thanks to your encouragement that I'm thinking this way.

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:38.620
Muroto-senpai.

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:41.240
I love you.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:48.920
From now on, I'm going to chase
after my dreams because I want to.

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:52.130
It's been my dream to be a doctor ever since I was little.

00:17:53.890 --> 00:18:00.930
I'm gonna work really hard and get into my first-choice university as valedictorian!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.680
That's the spirit, Senpai!

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:04.890
Hey, Maeda-kun.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:07.690
Will you continue to encourage me?

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:09.690
As imperfect as I am?

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:11.320
Sure.

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:13.390
Thanks.

00:18:13.390 --> 00:18:16.660
I knew you'd say yes.

00:18:17.700 --> 00:18:18.950
Well then...

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:22.120
Hold me.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.830
Weren't you going to encourage me?

00:18:25.830 --> 00:18:28.420
Dolphins were enough when I was little,

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.080
but I'm not a kid anymore.

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.920
A-Are you sure?

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:35.260
I'm the one who's asking here.

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:39.470
Th-Then...

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:48.020
Muroto-senpai...

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:51.730
I love you.

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.070
I really love you!

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:55.950
Thanks.

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:59.650
I... I love you too.

00:19:00.310 --> 00:19:04.580
Though you'll be graduating soon, I want to be with you forever.

00:19:06.620 --> 00:19:09.920
Then take me out again.

00:19:10.590 --> 00:19:12.170
Just like that time.

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:14.480
Yeah.

00:19:17.350 --> 00:19:18.840
Hey, let's kiss.

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:28.680
Softly. Please.

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:32.150
Close your eyes.

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.510
Don't worry.

00:19:57.510 --> 00:19:59.020
I'm sure your dreams will come true.

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:01.780
Maeda-kun...

00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:14.250
If you're free, could you come by the pool?

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:23.610
A photo opportunity!

00:20:29.780 --> 00:20:31.660
No splash!

00:20:34.300 --> 00:20:35.920
That was really good.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:41.030
Geez, I just wanted to let you know that I rejoined the Swim Club.

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:45.160
There's no way I'd pass up a chance to capture your true face.

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:46.430
Sheesh.

00:20:48.780 --> 00:20:51.840
I'm glad Muroto-senpai's back.

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:54.600
Yeah, we can't lose to her.

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:55.630
Let's practice.

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:57.260
Yeah, let's!

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:02.580
As if we'd let you keep all this
good stuff to yourself, Maeda!

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:06.950
I'll show you my boob-glimpse sniping skills!

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:10.000
Huh?

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:34.940
Time passed, and I got into my
first-choice university as valedictorian.

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:40.850
My hard work bore fruit thanks to you.

00:21:40.850 --> 00:21:43.740
You never stopped encouraging me.

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:45.650
Thank you so much.

00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:52.740
Every time I think about it, my heart skips a beat.

00:21:52.740 --> 00:21:55.750
They're all precious, precious memories.

00:21:56.790 --> 00:22:00.130
Today, I graduate.

00:22:20.090 --> 00:22:25.530
Maeda-kun, you're the only one who knows my bare face, the real me.

00:22:26.360 --> 00:22:29.030
You're the one who gave me my smile.

00:22:30.140 --> 00:22:31.410
I love you.

00:22:36.880 --> 00:22:39.700
Please come for me soon.

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:18.460
Masaki Nonoka.

00:24:18.460 --> 00:24:20.310
Fantastic at sports and full of innocence.

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:22.060
The ace of the Softball Club.

00:24:22.660 --> 00:24:25.310
Born on April 1st, April Fools' Day.

00:24:25.680 --> 00:24:27.150
Aries. Blood type B.

00:24:27.150 --> 00:24:29.660
Bust, very substantial.

00:24:29.660 --> 00:24:33.610
The eyes of all healthy young men are drawn to her bouncing chest as she pitches.

00:24:33.950 --> 00:24:36.700
Her well-worked curves are full of volume.

00:24:36.700 --> 00:24:37.700
Capture 'em, Maeda!

00:24:38.170 --> 00:24:40.910
Boing boing sniper!

00:24:41.850 --> 00:24:45.560
A stealth shot of that healthy tan.
